---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Features from "../components/Features.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Layout title="ppmlx — your apps, your models, your routes" description="Connect your AI tools to custom model routes. Set provider policies, run local MLX models, and keep a lightweight context graph on your Mac.">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main-content">
    <Hero />
    <Features />
    <section class="container memory-section" id="memory" aria-labelledby="memory-title">
      <h2 id="memory-title">Change the model.<br />Keep the context.</h2>
      <div class="section-copy">
        <p>Your project context should not belong to one provider. ppmlx keeps useful facts and connections in a lightweight graph on your Mac.</p>
        <p>You choose which apps can read it, and which project they can read.</p>
        <a class="quiet-link" href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx#memory-read-endpoints">Explore the memory graph</a>
        <p class="note">Experimental. Memory capture is off by default.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="container start-section" id="quickstart" aria-labelledby="start-title">
      <div><h2 id="start-title">Make it your own.</h2><p>Install ppmlx. Connect a provider or download a local model. Set your first route.</p><a class="quiet-link" href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx#install">Read the setup guide</a><p class="note">macOS on Apple Silicon. Python 3.11–3.12.</p></div>
      <pre tabindex="0" aria-label="Set up ppmlx and start the server"><code><span class="code-comment"># Connect your apps</span>
ppmlx onboard

<span class="code-comment"># Set your model routes</span>
ppmlx route

<span class="code-comment"># Start your endpoint</span>
ppmlx serve</code></pre>
    </section>
    <section class="container" aria-label="Project information"><div class="project-line"><p>Open source. Yours to inspect, change, and run.</p><div><a class="quiet-link" href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Changelog</a><a class="quiet-link" href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx/issues">Issues</a><a class="quiet-link" href="/turboquant">Experiments</a></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
<style>
.memory-section, .start-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34% minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 72px; padding-block: clamp(72px, 9vw, 128px); }
h2 { font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.2; }
p { max-width: 440px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; }
.section-copy p { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-dim); margin: 24px 0 0; }
.section-copy .note { margin-bottom: 0; }
.start-section { align-items: start; }
.start-section > div > p:not(.note) { max-width: 300px; }
pre { margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 28px; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }
pre code { font-size: inherit; }
.code-comment { color: var(--text-dim); }
.project-line { padding-block: 64px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
.project-line p { font-size: 12px; margin: 0; }
.project-line div { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.project-line a { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 12px; }
@media(max-width: 700px) {
  .memory-section, .start-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .start-section > div > p:not(.note) { max-width: 440px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .project-line { padding-block: 40px; }
}
</style>
